  "result": "Nothing in this repo implements the Manager limit yet, and there is no `specs/` folder, so these are based on the FR-001 rule in `AGENTS.md`. `ApprovalService.Approve` (`ApprovalService.cs:31`) takes only an approver name, with no role or amount check. `ApprovalsController` and the Domain policy were not in the file list, so I did not read them.\n\nTests I would add to `ApprovalPolicyTests` (`[Trait(\"Rule\", \"FR-001\")]`, literal amounts):\n\n1. Manager approves at exactly `50000.00m`.\n2. Manager approves a small amount, `100.00m`.\n3. Manager is refused at `50000.01m`. Assert the exception and reason code, a snapshot copy of the invoice unchanged, and that `Update` was not called.\n4. Director approves at `50000.00m`.\n5. Admin or an unknown role is refused at `100.00m` (fail closed).\n6. Manager rejection at `50000.01m` is still allowed.",
